{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "digisophie",
 "version": "1.1.13f-chain",
 "title": "SOPHIE",
 "description": "Two-operator metallic percussion adaptation of Sophie with four distinct models. Its audio enters the normal Digitakt AMP, filter, mixer and sends; the source filter and drive are intentionally not ported. This build combines with the other SRC machine mods through digichain, which it needs (tools/chain_patch.py moved 17 of its sites there; its code is unchanged).",
 "category": "Synthesis",
 "author": "digisophie contributors",
 "license": "MIT",
